  "game_version": "24087620",
  "author": "Prolution",
  "description": "This version increases the mission time limit, adds a few extra buildable units and improves the scenario. known bug number 1: if you save midgame and then turn off the mod. If you try to open operations the game crashes. To fix this crash, you need to go into your locals folder and get rid of the .rusesav file(s) that was created when you saved your modded game. C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\userdata\\#########\\21970 TLDR: don't save game when playing the mod.\nTwo options to play!\na). First DDAY mission in Campaign - this has no time limit (less hard mode)\nb). Last operation in Operations - this has a 60 minute time limit (hard mode)",
